  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program in Support of Mexico&apos;s Climate Change Agenda</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa en Apoyo a la Agenda de Cambio Climtico de Mxico</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El Programa tiene por objetivo fomentar los instrumentos y medios necesarios para implementar la agenda de mitigacin y adaptacin al cambio climtico con base en un marco operativo; y fortalecer el marco institucional para apoyar la implementacin transversal de consideraciones de cambio climtico en las polticas pblicas (mainstreaming).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Program is to develop the instruments and means necessary to implement the climate change mitigation and adaptation agenda based on an operational framework and to strengthen the institutional framework to support the mainstreaming of climate change considerations into public policy.</narrative>
  </description>
